    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_AboutPurposeTitle">What Metadata AI does</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_AboutMetadata">Generate, translate and standardize descriptions, genres, tags, categories, companies, ratings, regions, links, release dates, series and sorting names. Each field has its own safe apply rule, so existing data can be preserved, completed, appended or replaced only when you choose.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_AboutMedia">Find covers, icons and backgrounds from configurable official, community and web sources. You can review candidates manually, choose a resolution, crop position and output format, or let the plugin apply your configured priorities automatically.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="MTDA_AboutControl">Use simulation before applying changes, inspect history and provenance afterwards, and run a library audit to find incomplete metadata or media. The plugin is designed to help curate and normalize your library, not to invent uncertain factual information.</sys:String>
